{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105435","id":2997376916,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SuEFk","number":105435,"title":"Add Auto CPU/GPU sync mode (renderer low latency)","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-15T19:21:09Z","updated_at":"2025-05-10T11:00:37Z","closed_at":"2025-05-09T21:47:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105435","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105435","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105435.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Add CPU_GPU_SYNC_AUTO\r\nRemove redundant calls to get_ticks_usec()\r\n\r\nFixes an unrelated bug when NAVIGATION_2D_DISABLED or NAVIGATION_3D_DISABLED are defined.\r\n\r\nThis is a modified version of #100031\r\n\r\nNotable changes:\r\n\r\n1. Forbids the use of `CPU_GPU_SYNC_SEQUENTIAL` in production. It is allowed in the Editor, as it has its uses for debugging tight timing issues.\r\n2. Adds `CPU_GPU_SYNC_AUTO` which decides on realtime whether to use SEQUENTIAL or PARALLEL.\r\n    - AUTO is disabled on OpenGL. The timing was too unreliable and every time it switched between SEQ and PAR a very visible stutter would occur.\r\n    - AUTO has been tested by me on:\r\n        - Vulkan Linux AMD (Mesa RADV)\r\n        - Vulkan Windows AMD\r\n        - Vulkan Windows NVIDIA\r\n        - D3D12 Windows AMD\r\n        - D3D12 Windows NVIDIA\r\n3. Refactors the code as it lives in RenderingServer, since frame pacing is irrespective of implementation. It addresses the problems found [in this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100031#issuecomment-2790860295). Frame Pacing code is a bit odd, because it involves very low level mechanisms (e.g. synchronization) but it needs to be aware of the engine as a whole at a very high level (in fact changes, albeit small, go all way to main.cpp).\r\n3. Adds monitors to debug and understand by AUTO decides to use SEQ or PAR.\r\n    - Those monitors are very useful even outside of frame pacing. They are very sensible to frame spikes and can detect issues that would cause stutter problems (even outside of AUTO/SEQ/PAR; as any frame time spike or hard missed target is very bad)\r\n\r\nThis is how the Monitors look like on a simple project, V-Sync enabled:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6fb279a-0f23-4b72-93c6-02e6b9a0798b)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105435/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}